From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lichii <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Nov 2026 13:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] stream: include <cstdlib> for std::abort

libc++ 23 no longer includes <cstdlib> through the other standard headers, so
std::abort in stream.h fails to compile with llvm-mingw's clang 23.
---
 src/stream.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/stream.h b/src/stream.h
--- a/src/stream.h
+++ b/src/stream.h
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 #include <cassert>
 #include <concepts>
 #include <cstddef>
+#include <cstdlib>
 #include <functional>
 #include <string_view>
 #include <unordered_map>
